---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section id="about" class="section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <SectionHeading number="03" title="A little context" id="about-heading" note="Experience Architecture / Michigan State University" />
  <div class="about-grid"><p class="about-statement">Thoughtful design starts<br />with better questions.</p><div><p>My background in Experience Architecture informs how I approach information, tasks, and the connections between interfaces and the situations around them. The projects here were developed collaboratively, with shared work across the process.</p><aside id="resume" class="resume-note" aria-labelledby="resume-heading"><h3 id="resume-heading">Resume</h3>{site.resumeHref ? <a class="text-link" href={site.resumeHref}>Read the resume (PDF) <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a> : <><p>The resume is awaiting owner approval for this review. Dates and employment details will be published only after confirmation.</p><span class="content-note">Resume pending approval</span></>}</aside><details class="site-implementation"><summary>About this site</summary><p>This portfolio uses Astro, TypeScript, semantic HTML, and CSS. Project records include evidence references; automated checks cover content provenance, keyboard navigation, responsive layouts, and accessibility.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/koncagu2-cloud/enhanced-portfolio">View the portfolio source and review history</a></p></details></div></div>
</section>
